Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:04.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}31 and 0 now for Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇如今在这里{\fs78}31{\fs68}胜{\fs78}0{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:07.97,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}先丢一盘 再连扳两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.97,0:00:11.75,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约拼了将近三小时 才赢下这一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.92,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}2{\fs68}号晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:17.96,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}中网男单第二轮 德约对小布
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:23.46,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This time, Bu does make his move.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一次 小布抓住机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:25.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}First break of this opening set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是首盘的第一次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:28.86,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘唯一一次破发属于小布
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:30.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}来到他的胜盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:32.48,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约只能继续追
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:41.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So, Bu Yunchaokete stops a run of 29 consecutive sets here in Beijing for Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N小布终结德约北京连赢{\fs78}29{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:45.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 小布先拔头筹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:47.04,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘德约{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:48.84,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}又被立刻回破
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.14,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这个平分 双方把底线拉开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:54.34,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}一拍接着一拍 谁都不肯先退
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:09.62,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a point!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哇 多么精彩的一分！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.30,0:01:12.96,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一盘的胜负 来到抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:15.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约拿到了盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:18.40,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, are we really surprised?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们真的会感到意外吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:24.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Novak Djokovic bounces back in the second set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇在第二盘扳了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.15,0:01:28.23,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}抢七{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}之后 德约连拿五分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.23,0:01:30.33,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 比赛扳平
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.33,0:01:31.69,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决胜盘第一局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:34.11,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}又是一段{\fs78}20{\fs68}多秒的拉锯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.11,0:01:35.45,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}谁想先拿优势
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:37.99,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}都得从这一拍一拍里争
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.55,0:01:54.67,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It’s a lightning quick start from Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇开局快如闪电
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.73,0:01:55.99,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Team up on their feet.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他的团队都站起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:59.77,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约已经{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先 小布仍在争
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.77,0:02:01.49,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}把对手拉到边线之外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:03.86,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}逼出跑动中的回球失误
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:06.48,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}赛后小布说 他珍惜这次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}想要每球必争
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:13.36,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How has he won that point?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他究竟是怎么赢下这一分的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.10,0:02:20.89,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}全场二发得分 小布{\fs78}43{\fs68}% 德约{\fs78}73{\fs68}%
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:22.38,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}没有一发护航时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.38,0:02:24.07,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约多守住的那些分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.07,0:02:26.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}成了逆转的底气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:30.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}反手打向空当
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:33.02,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约连扳两盘 逆转晋级
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:37.98,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Novak Djokovic keeps his streak alive here in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约延续北京连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:43.04,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}31 and 0 now for Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇如今在这里{\fs78}31{\fs68}胜{\fs78}0{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:48.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}At times it didn’t look like it was going to happen today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天曾一度难以续写纪录
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:50.95,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约为自己的付出骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:52.99,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}小布仍想每球必争
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.99,0:02:53.83,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}下一轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.83,0:02:57.04,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约对兹维列夫与商竣程之间的胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:59.65,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}你最想为哪一分鼓掌？
